  "scene": {
    "id": "S2-asbuilt",
    "title": "Option 2 as built · HRPN main @667529f (2026-10-12)",
    "caption": "Source of truth: this repository at `main` @667529f (`genair-infra-factory/`, `src/agents/ragengine-agent/`). A Google Chat app\npublishes to the Pub/Sub topic `hrpn-gchat-events`; a push subscription with an OIDC token of the pod service account calls\n`/gchat-push` on Cloud Run `hrpn-ragengine-agent`, a FastAPI app from ADK `get_fast_api_app` that also serves the ADK web UI (CORS `*`).\nThe route answers 200 first, then a background task runs the `LlmAgent` (gemini-2.5-flash, generic `GenAiR_RAG_Agent` prompt) on\nVertex AI RAG Engine (RagManaged Basic, corpus `hr_policies`) and replies through the Chat REST API.\nRed frames: Chat sessions in `InMemorySessionService` keyed by the space name (lost on restart, shared in group spaces), no event check\nor dedup, corpus admin tools callable by any user, user text logged at INFO; absent: citations, 1–5 feedback, eligibility check, Drive sync.\nTwo runtimes coexist: Agent Engine `hrpn-ae-ragengine-agent` (AdkApp, Terraform) is deployed but no Chat path calls it (deployed state verified 2026-10-19: engine 6891800455551123456 beside Cloud Run revision `00005-fqc`; the out-of-Terraform LB backend `hrpn-gchat-push-backend` exists, unused by the push subscription, which targets the `*.run.app` URL).\nTemplate bricks without a consumer (bucket, Firestore, Phoenix, feedback sink) stay visible as dormant. End-to-end delivery: `unknown` after the 2026-10-12 commits (org policy `iam.allowedPolicyMemberDomains` blocked earlier paths).\nPlatform inheritance: GenAiR-Cutter 26.9.0 (github.airbus.corp, AgentGarden as submodule) generated the repo and pushed it to the POD SSM repository `prj-ssm-b967/hr-polnav-c700-repo`; Terraform reads the genair-infra-factory modules from their SSM mirror; Cloud Build (same POD project) deploys on the SSM webhook. Everything runs in POD: the PROD mode of the template (`app_code`, dev/int/pro projects, Jenkins on AWS with WIF) was not run, and no HRPN repository on the Airbus SCM (GitLab / GitHub) was found (red frames).",
    "legendPassages": [
      "Red frames: Chat sessions in `InMemorySessionService` keyed by the space name (lost on restart, shared in group spaces), no event check or dedup, corpus admin tools callable by any user, user text logged at INFO; absent: citations, 1–5 feedback, eligibility check, Drive sync."
    ]
  },
